{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1745","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"level":3,"runs":[{"text":"社会现实复杂多样，人间世相千姿百态","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"我们需要以正确的立场、睿智的头脑和敏锐的眼睛，去观察思考，分析鉴别。\n\n本单元所选五篇小说，通过虚构的人物形象与故事情节反映社会生活，描摹人情世态，表达对人生的思索。阅读这些小说，可以丰富人生体验，提升对社会现实观察、分析、判断的能力，激发想象，培养高尚的审美情趣。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要注意知人论世，在人物与社会环境共生、互动的关系中认识人物性格的形成和发展，关注作品的社会批判性。要了解作者如何运用多种艺术手法实现创作意图，品味小说在形象、情节、语言等方面的独特魅力，欣赏小说不同的风格类型；学习用读书提要或读书笔记记录自己的阅读感受和见解，借鉴小说技法进行创作。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":163494,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-743dc9befeceff3f21dc","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"9ca674de13cb8dab251817caaad6e6fe2cd668f0989b2ca3b013e60b93cd2e67","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1701}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11194,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","postId":11194,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27097b149275120c07fa03b6d8c7ac2a0ad20f8d.jpeg","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11194-h-1","postId":11194,"pos